# sp_avatr_support — the PUBLIC face of the SP Avatr toolkit.
#
# Deliberately short. This repo is a static site plus a folder of release
# binaries, so the usual "ignore build output" rules would be actively wrong:
# sp_suites/*.apk and sp_suites/sp-broker.jar ARE the product here, they are
# written by tools/release/publish_support_site.py in the private toolkit repo,
# and a rule that skipped them would make every publish silently push nothing.
# Do not add *.apk, *.jar, or dist/ below.

# macOS / editor litter — the only things that ever appear here uninvited.
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Jekyll is switched off by .nojekyll (tracked), but if anyone ever runs it
# locally these are its output, not ours.
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.sass-cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GUARD RULES — these match nothing today, and exist so that a mistake cannot
# become a public commit. Every credential in the private toolkit repo is
# committed there ON PURPOSE, which is exactly why none of it may land here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
tester-*.pem
*.env
